Then verify authentication and role enforcement:

# No credentials: expect HTTP 401
curl -s -o /dev/null -w "%{http_code}\n" http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile

# Correct user credentials: expect HTTP 200
curl -s -u user:user123 http://localhost:8080/api/user/profile

# User credentials against admin endpoint: expect HTTP 403
